 ## ACT 01 — A public launch, a hidden cargo
 
 ### A01-P01
-A champagne bottle breaks against the bow. Families have been invited to watch. At a Pennsylvania shipyard, a new vessel enters the water under Howard Hughes's name. Its advertised job is mining the ocean floor. Its real job must never appear above the surface.
